@@ -21,6 +21,13 @@ The build will create two jar files:
 * the command line interface in the cli/target folder
 * the interactive explorer in the codeexplorer/target folder
 
+### Landscape commands
+
+* `analyzeLandscape -analysisRoot <folder>`: creates or refreshes a landscape report (`<folder>/_sokrates_landscape/config.json` and `index.html`), aggregating the analyses found under the analysis root. It is the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands.
+* `updateLandscape`: the older name of the same command, with the same options; kept so existing scripts keep working.
+
+Run `java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -help` for all options.
+
